---
---
<section class="py-24 bg-white border-y border-brand-orange/5" id="instalacion">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-orange bg-brand-orange-light px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">
        Puesta en Marcha Rápida
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-display font-extrabold text-brand-navy tracking-tight mt-3 mb-4">
        Instala RestoFinance en menos de 2 minutos
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-brand-navy/70 leading-relaxed">
        El proceso está pensado para ser simple, autónomo y rápido. Sigue los pasos de nuestra guía para empezar a tomar comandas hoy mismo.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Centered 3 Numbered Steps Timeline -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto flex flex-col gap-8 relative">
      
      <!-- Vertical Timeline Line Connector -->
      <div class="absolute left-6.5 top-8 bottom-8 w-0.5 border-l-2 border-dashed border-brand-orange/20 pointer-events-none hidden sm:block"></div>

      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-5 items-start relative z-10 group">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-13 h-13 rounded-2xl bg-brand-orange-light text-brand-orange border border-brand-orange/20 flex items-center justify-center font-display font-extrabold text-lg shadow-sm group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-200">
          1
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-navy mb-1 group-hover:text-brand-orange transition-colors">Descarga el instalador</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-navy/70 leading-relaxed mb-2.5">
            Haz clic en el botón de descarga para obtener <code class="bg-brand-cream px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-brand-orange/15 text-xs text-brand-orange font-semibold font-mono">RestoFinance_1.0.0_x64-setup.exe</code> (78MB). Es 100% libre de virus.
          </p>
          <a 
            href="https://github.com/Francisco-jvcmd/RestoFinance-Instalador/releases/download/v1.0.0/RestoFinance_1.0.0_x64-setup.exe" 
            id="btn-download-step"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-brand-teal hover:text-brand-orange transition-colors"
          >
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-4l-4 4m0 0l-4-4m4 4V4"></path></svg>
            Descarga Directa para Windows
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-5 items-start relative z-10 group">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-13 h-13 rounded-2xl bg-brand-teal-light text-brand-teal border border-brand-teal/20 flex items-center justify-center font-display font-extrabold text-lg shadow-sm group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-200">
          2
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-navy mb-1 group-hover:text-brand-teal transition-colors">Ejecuta el instalador</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-navy/70 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            Abre el instalador en tu sistema operativo Windows (10 u 11). Sigue el asistente guiado de instalación paso a paso. Se creará automáticamente un acceso directo en tu escritorio.
          </p>

          <!-- SmartScreen Guide (collapsible) -->
          <details class="bg-brand-cream/60 border border-brand-orange/10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden" id="smartscreen-guide">
            <summary class="cursor-pointer px-4 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-brand-navy hover:text-brand-orange transition-colors select-none flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-orange shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 details-arrow" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
              Windows muestra un aviso de seguridad al abrir el instalador
            </summary>
            <div class="px-4 pb-4 pt-1 space-y-3">
              <p class="text-xs text-brand-navy/70 leading-relaxed">
                Este aviso aparece porque el programa aún no cuenta con una firma digital certificada. Es completamente seguro. Para continuar:
              </p>
              <ol class="space-y-2 text-xs text-brand-navy/80">
                <li class="flex gap-3 items-start">
                  <span class="shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-brand-orange-light text-brand-orange flex items-center justify-center font-display font-bold text-[11px] border border-brand-orange/15">1</span>
                  <span>En la ventana del aviso, haz clic en <strong class="text-brand-navy">"Más información"</strong> (texto azul subrayado).</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex gap-3 items-start">
                  <span class="shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-brand-orange-light text-brand-orange flex items-center justify-center font-display font-bold text-[11px] border border-brand-orange/15">2</span>
                  <span>Aparecerá un botón nuevo. Haz clic en <strong class="text-brand-navy">"Ejecutar de todas formas"</strong>.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex gap-3 items-start">
                  <span class="shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-brand-orange-light text-brand-orange flex items-center justify-center font-display font-bold text-[11px] border border-brand-orange/15">3</span>
                  <span>El instalador se abrirá con normalidad. <strong class="text-brand-navy">Esto solo sucede la primera vez.</strong></span>
                </li>
              </ol>
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2 bg-brand-teal-light border border-brand-teal/15 rounded-xl px-3 py-2.5">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-teal shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"></path></svg>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-brand-teal font-semibold leading-relaxed">RestoFinance es un software seguro. Estamos en proceso de obtener la firma digital para eliminar este aviso.</p>
              </div>
              <a 
                href="/guia-instalacion" 
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-brand-teal hover:text-brand-orange transition-colors"
              >
                Ver guía completa paso a paso
                <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
              </a>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-5 items-start relative z-10 group">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-13 h-13 rounded-2xl bg-[#FFF1EB] text-[#E85D1B] border border-brand-orange/20 flex items-center justify-center font-display font-extrabold text-lg shadow-sm group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-200">
          3
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-navy mb-1 group-hover:text-brand-orange transition-colors">Ingresa tu clave de activación</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-navy/70 leading-relaxed">
            Inicia el software en tu computadora e introduce la clave de licencia que compraste. Puedes solicitar tu licencia mensual o anual a través de WhatsApp abajo. Estarás listo para vender de forma local y 100% offline.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- Rotate arrow on <details> open -->
<style>
  details[open] .details-arrow {
    transform: rotate(90deg);
  }
</style>

<!-- Script to handle download toast -->
<script>
  const downloadStepBtn = document.getElementById('btn-download-step');

  // Toast listener interface for secondary download link
  if (downloadStepBtn) {
    downloadStepBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      // Dispatch a custom event to communicate with the toast defined in Hero.astro
      const event = new CustomEvent('show-toast', {
        detail: {
          title: '¡Descarga Iniciada!',
          message: 'El instalador seguro "RestoFinance_1.0.0_x64-setup.exe" se está preparando para descargar.',
          type: 'download'
        }
      });
      window.dispatchEvent(event);
    });
  }
</script>
